cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills or reference this methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "An agentic data newsroom: reusable Agent Skills for investigative journalism over federal lobbying disclosures"
abstract: >-
  Winning entry to the GAIN Agentic AI Investigative Journalism Challenge
  (Northwestern University, 2026). Seven MIT-licensed Agent Skills spanning
  the full pipeline from raw records to verified finding — dataset profiling,
  verifiable SQLite ingestion, corpus orientation, and a three-skill newsroom
  workflow (screen design, lead surfacing with editorial gates, and
  cross-session case tracking with builder/skeptic/judge verification) — plus
  the findings report and complete investigation working state they produced
  over House and Senate lobbying disclosures and congressional press releases,
  2022–2026 Q1.
type: software
authors:
